{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>HOY人氣處境劇《你的保安李寶安》最新一集，上集有前女優濱崎真緒加盟，大獲好評！來到今晚第11集，前TVB小花 …</p><p></p>\n<p>HOY人氣處境劇《你的保安李寶安》最新一集，上集有前女優濱崎真緒加盟，大獲好評！來到今晚第11集，前TVB小花江嘉敏加盟相當有驚喜！</p>\n<h2>羅宋湯慘戴綠帽揭開驚天身世之謎</h2>\n<p>第11集劇情講述，神秘高層秘書Creamy小忌廉強勢突襲保安部，期間與羅宋湯舉止極度親密。深愛男方阿彩因吃醋而展開瘋狂追查，意外揭發二人不僅曾經同居，目前更處於商議離婚及分配家產階段，甚至已經育有1名小孩。正當阿彩深明大義甘願承擔共同撫養孩子責任時，Creamy小忌廉竟當眾爆出「孩子不是羅宋湯的」震撼宣言，令劇情瞬間推向高潮。</p>\n<h2>江嘉敏社交平台分享爆笑幕後花絮</h2>\n<p>飾演Creamy小忌廉女星江嘉敏隨即在社交平台大爆拍攝感受，並上載多張充滿歡樂氣氛幕後合照。她對於劇中角色遭遇幽默留言「難得～Creamy姐被仔飛，Sad緊，平時係我飛人㗎嘛」。她特別提到同劇演員為了完成合照，二話不說換回整套保安制服，當有網民好奇追問邱副隊長下半身衣著時，她亦搞笑親自證實「有著👖」。她更展示1張與導演精心修圖2小時合照，力證整個劇組合作充滿火花。</p>\n<h2>秘書小忌廉強勢介入觸發三角戀危機</h2>\n<p>劇中錯綜複雜三角關係成為整集最大亮點，江嘉敏同妹頭（阿彩）為爭奪男主角各出奇謀。阿彩一直誤會男方與秘書小忌廉之間只屬普通同事關係，直到殘酷真相浮出水面才驚覺自己一直處於劣勢。江嘉敏那種帶點挑剔又高傲姿態，與阿彩那份單純可愛形成極強烈對比。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚：江嘉敏做得自然又搞笑</h2>\n<p>大批觀眾看畢此集後紛紛湧入討論區踴躍留言，一致認為今集劇情緊湊程度已經超越早前好彩食麻糬一幕。不少網民高度評價兩位女角表現，特別指出「妹姐好生鬼好可愛，meaning夠養眼」，同時亦有大批留言讚賞「江嘉敏做得自然又搞笑」。觀眾普遍認為江嘉敏將角色那種高傲氣質拿捏得恰到好處，即使展現挑剔一面依然充滿喜感，紛紛留言表達會繼續期待這條感情線發展。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440730314040814_6572828066af47b87bdcc8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440730314040814_6572828066af47b87bdcc8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>來到今晚第11集，前TVB小花江嘉敏加盟相當有驚喜！（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440730825880848_5754567316af47b8c9975f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-9\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440730825880848_5754567316af47b8c9975f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>喜感十足！（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440731174063155_18549002886af47b90213de.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-10\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440731174063155_18549002886af47b90213de.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>妹頭演出都有進步！（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440731680150951_5915351626af47b954e8a0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440731680150951_5915351626af47b954e8a0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>神秘高層秘書Creamy小忌廉強勢突襲保安部，期間與羅宋湯舉止極度親密。（圖片來源：江嘉敏IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440731925253463_17765642916af47b97b542c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440731925253463_17765642916af47b97b542c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>她更展示1張與導演精心修圖2小時合照，力證整個劇組合作充滿火花。（圖片來源：江嘉敏IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440732356338144_2185498026af47b9c0b41f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440732356338144_2185498026af47b9c0b41f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：江嘉敏IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944073257332429_3111672236af47b9e1067a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944073257332429_3111672236af47b9e1067a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：江嘉敏IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794407328255592_2407050636af47ba0ae08c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794407328255592_2407050636af47ba0ae08c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：江嘉敏IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440733027369346_6410716836af47ba2c6627.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440733027369346_6410716836af47ba2c6627.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：江嘉敏IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%bd%a0%e7%9a%84%e4%bf%9d%e5%ae%89%e6%9d%8e%e5%af%b6%e5%ae%89/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">你的保安李寶安</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%b1%9f%e5%98%89%e6%95%8f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">江嘉敏</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%be%85%e5%ae%8b%e6%b9%af/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅宋湯</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3540681\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 11 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T15:51:20.447427+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1364,"images":9,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T14:28:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T19:57:27.851339+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T15:44:49.867381+00:00","content_hash":"b20e9454e7e2767c68e5dedb9d9a5dda2853cfce843337170e8dc298c84f0d34","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}